  "prompt": "A slow-mo single delicate flower captured in extreme macro, entirely out of focus, with soft, velvety petals appearing semi-transparent and luminous. The petals display ethereal gradients shifting between warm coral pinks, vibrant oranges, golden yellows, soft violets, and cool sky blues, with light scattering and blending gently across their surfaces. The background is a smooth pastel sky gradient, slightly blurred, evoking a dreamy, serene mood. The flower moves very slowly and gracefull in a continuous, fluid, wave-like motion no gusts of wind, no jitter, only elegant, rhythmic oscillations as if gently floating in an unseen current. The motion is hypnotic and meditative, with each sway lasting several seconds before reversing direction. Depth of field remains extremely shallow, keeping the entire subject in a soft haze, with cinematic bokeh glow and a diffuse, airy atmosphere. Shot with a 100mm macro lens, wide open at f/1.8, producing a creamy bokeh and extremely shallow focus plane. Soft backlighting enhances translucency and glow, with high dynamic range capturing subtle color transitions. Filmed at 24fps in real time for a calming, dreamlike visual effect. --ar 51:91 --motion high --raw --video 1",
